    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grav My Balls is a first person shooter/ puzzle game where you change the gravity on certain objects you shoot. Turn gravity on, off, or lock in place by shooting balls out of the mysterious attachments built into your hands. Use your balls and your wits to traverse and solve puzzles within the strange location you are stuck in. You will unlock special modified balls along your journey to help you solve puzzles and figure out why you are here. Do you have the balls to get out alive?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grav My Balls is a first person shooter/ puzzle game where you change the gravity on certain objects you shoot. Turn gravity on, off, or lock in place by shooting balls out of the mysterious attachments built into your hands. Use your balls and your wits to traverse and solve puzzles within the strange location you are stuck in. You will unlock special modified balls along your journey to help you solve puzzles and figure out why you are here. Do you have the balls to get out alive?</p>",
    "short_description": "Grav your balls and let them fly! You are trapped and must escape with the help of the strange tech built into your hands. Launch your balls to change gravity on objects blocking your path. Use your mind and your new powers to solve gravity and mind bending puzzles.",
